  "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>JUST LISTED: Super-fresh Bayliner 185 BR - ready to hit the water!&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Ready to enjoy some outdoor quality time yet this Summer?&nbsp; This one is just off a bow-to-stern detail and tune-up, and will carry your friends and family in style...clean inside, outside and everywhere in-between.&nbsp; Fiberglass &amp; vinyl are in excellent shape, as is its economical MerCruiser 3.0 TKS motor (no hour meter).&nbsp; Comes complete with a matched Karavan galvanized trailer.&nbsp; Bimini top will regulate the rays, and snap-on cover will keep her looking good when at rest.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Plan your next adventure, and come take a look in Quest's Ottawa, Illinois showroom!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
